  _headline: 'Cidade no escuro: Energia em Colapso'
  _headlineEn: 'City in the dark: Energy collapses'
  _body: "Com {valor}, falta luz at\xE9 no gabinete, e o prefeito despacha com a
    lanterna do celular. O Bem-estar sente a cada turno."
  _bodyEn: At {valor}, even City Hall has no power, and the mayor works by phone
    flashlight. Well-being feels it every turn.
